Download the FREE Upside App at https://upside.app.link/cboys to get an extra 25 cents back for every gallon on your first tank of gas. 

Get entered for the giveaway here: https://cboystv.com/ 

LIMIT OF 100E NTRIES PER PERSON/EMAIL ADDRESS. NO PURCHASE OR PAYMENT OF ANY KIND IS NECESSARY TO ENTER OR WIN. PURCHASE OR PAYMENT DOES NOT IMPROVE YOUR CHANCE OF WINNING. The CBoysTV Ford Giveaway is open to residents of the 50 US States & DC, & Canada(excluding QC), 13+. Void elsewhere&where prohibited. Ends 8/16/2026. Skill testing question required for Canada residents.One (1) Grand Prize: Winner's choice from a pre-owned 2023 Ford GT500 (ARV:$100,000USD) or a pre-owned 2023 Ford Raptor R (ARV: $90,000USD) plus $20,000 USD. Subject to Official Rules at bit.ly/CBoysTVFordGiveaway. 

Subscribe to our Podcast: https://www.youtube.com/c/LifeWideOpenwithCboysTV/featured 

